# Font-build source cache: keep the source TTFs in git so make-app-fonts.py can
# rebuild SkyFont from a clean clone (the Alibaba TTFs have no stable download
# URL); ignore only non-font cache junk (e.g. transient merge temporaries).
tools/.fontcache/*
!tools/.fontcache/*.ttf
/.venv-clean-dss/
# local DSS cleanup work-trees (rollback backup + staging output; not shipped as-is)
apps/skydata/surveys/dss-backup/
apps/skydata/surveys/dss-clean/
.claude/launch.json
.DS_Store
# JetBrains IDE project config — untracked (was committed; now a per-dev choice)
.idea/
node_modules/.vite/vitest/da39a3ee5e6b4b0d3255bfef95601890afd80709/results.json
# 给 App 侧的一次性 dist 导出包（正式产物在 unigo/assets/dist.zip）
apps/skymap-web/dist-*.zip
# tools/make-dist-zip.sh 在 dist.zip 旁写的来源 sidecar（.sha256 / .json），
# 本身也是构建产物，不进库；nested .gitignore 只忽略了 dist.zip 本身
apps/skymap-web/dist.zip*
# Raw Alibaba font source archives (huge — incl. a 278MB PuHuiTi zip). The
# extracted source TTFs under tools/.fontcache/ are what we track instead.
dev_docs/*.zip
tools/plate_catalog/gsss/
tools/halpha-build/
# Internal documentation lives in the private docs repository. Locally these
# paths are symlinks into it (see README "Repository layout"); never commit.
/dev_docs
/docs
/.superpowers
# DSS castclean 的本地输出（tools/plate_eq/assemble.py 读），不进库
/dss-cast-cleaned/
!tools/.fontcache/LICENSES.md
!tools/.fontcache/OFL.txt
